  "jcr:description": "High-definition endoscopic camera systems that are used to produce still and video images in the surgical field during surgical endoscopic procedures. The system is sensitive in the visible and infrared spectrum. The optical image is transferred from the surgical site to the camera head by a variety of rigid and flexible scopes which are attached to the camera head. The system consists of a camera control unit (CCU) and a camera head with an integral cable that connects to the CCU.",
